5. LDPE Plugs
5.1 Clarity check                                 Date:________________
  1  cut open partially the inner bag with presterilized S.S. Scissor under
     filteration LAF.
  2  Pick up 15 LDPE plugs with forcep & put in a 500 stoppered glass flask 
     containing filtered & sterilized W.F.I.& check for the plug clarity.
  3  Repeat this for each bag before using for the batch quantity.

5.2  If clarity is okay, transfer plugs in previously cleaned S.S hopper of
     LDPE plugging machine.

5.3  Keep the opened bag in a sterilized s.s container with a tight lid fitting
     under LAF.

5.4  BALANCE PLUGS :-

  1  Discard the plugs which are fallen on table top, floor etc.
  2  After completion of batch plugs left in the hopper should be collected in
     a clean bag and with a status label " TO BE WASHED " given outside.

